	"f2p_sc_ot_mara_2": "Off the clock",
	"f2p_sc_ot_wes_1": "Moving day",
	"f2p_sc_ot_wes_2": "The couch on seven",
	"f2p_sc_ot_nia_1": "Off the books",
	"f2p_sc_ot_nia_2": "The blazer comes off",
	"f2p_sc_ot_sol_1": "Late edition",
	"f2p_sc_ot_sol_2": "Stop the presses",
	"f2p_sc_ot_b2": "The glass office",
	"f2p_sc_ot_b3": "Floor nine",
	"f2p_sc_ot_b4": "The quiet floor",
	"f2p_sc_ot_b5": "Keys to the city",
	"f2p_tier_mirei_1": "You fixed the lights on four before I asked. I noticed. I notice most things; I just don't usually say so.",
	"f2p_tier_mirei_2": "Stay for one drink after close. Not about the building. I'd like to hear about something that isn't the building.",
	"f2p_tier_mirei_4": "I bought this place to be alone in it. Funny how that went. Come up to the top floor after close; the view's better with two.",
	"f2p_tier_dan_1": "You drink the coffee from the fourth-floor machine too? Brave. We should start a support group.",
	"f2p_tier_dan_2": "The build went green at 3 a.m. and you were the only other person here to see it. That counts for something.",
	"f2p_tier_dan_4": "I keep a spare mug in my desk. It's yours now, apparently. I didn't decide that; it just happened.",
	"f2p_tier_priya_1": "Don't tell facilities I have the roof key. Actually, tell them. I want to see their faces.",
	"f2p_tier_priya_2": "You held the ladder without being asked. Most people just watch. Come up on the roof sometime; I'll show you the good ledge.",
	"f2p_tier_priya_4": "I keep a thermos up on the roof for sunsets. It's a two-person thermos. I checked.",
	"f2p_tier_mara_1": "You signed the fire log correctly. Nobody signs the fire log correctly. I'm reconsidering my opinion of you.",
	"f2p_tier_mara_2": "Every door in this building has a key on my ring. There's one door I'd like to open for somebody. Don't read into that. Do read into it a little.",
	"f2p_tier_mara_4": "I made you a copy of the roof key. It's not an access card. It's a key. There's a difference and I think you know it.",
	"f2p_tier_wes_1": "I have a meeting at midnight. With whom? With you, now. Consider it scheduled.",
	"f2p_tier_wes_2": "Nia says I talk too much. You don't seem to mind. That's either kindness or bad hearing, and I'll take either.",
	"f2p_tier_wes_4": "I found a couch nobody's claimed on seven. I'm claiming it. For two. Don't tell Nia; she'll audit it.",
	"f2p_tier_nia_1": "Your figures reconcile. Do you know how rare that is? I could kiss you. Professionally speaking, I won't. Yet.",
	"f2p_tier_nia_2": "I audit people for a living. You're the first one I've wanted to spend an evening getting wrong about.",
	"f2p_tier_nia_4": "I don't take the blazer off at work. Not for anyone. Just so you know what it means when I do.",
	"f2p_tier_sol_1": "The paper stopped printing years ago. I still file at four. You're the first person who's asked to read it.",
	"f2p_tier_sol_2": "I wrote a column about this building. You're in paragraph three. You come off well; I'm biased.",
	"f2p_tier_sol_4": "Stop the presses, I said, out loud, to nobody, when you walked in. I've never said that in my life. Sit down.",
	"f2p_ev_ev_audit_title": "Audit Week",
	"f2p_ev_ev_audit_text": "Nia is auditing Pike Harlan's filings, and this week she counts twice.",
	"f2p_ev_ev_launch_title": "Launch Week",
	"f2p_ev_ev_launch_text": "Dan's build ships on Friday. Keep the coffee coming.",
	"f2p_ev_ev_open_title": "Open House",
